[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11522.389, "timestamp": "03:12:02", "text": "差不多，但还不对。她也很有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11525.19, "timestamp": "03:12:05", "text": "别担心，你只会崩溃 2 秒钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11527.83, "timestamp": "03:12:07", "text": "第一个月每 2 秒钟发生一次。后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11530.7, "timestamp": "03:12:10", "text": "你会慢慢掌握的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11532.79, "timestamp": "03:12:12", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11536.63, "timestamp": "03:12:16", "text": "所以，是的，枪支无法发射。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11539.67, "timestamp": "03:12:19", "text": "你自己的螺旋桨是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11541.429, "timestamp": "03:12:21", "text": "你知道，汽车里有个曲轴，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11543.429, "timestamp": "03:12:23", "text": "正确的？有一根杆连接着你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11546.15, "timestamp": "03:12:26", "text": "发动机和轮胎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11548.389, "timestamp": "03:12:28", "text": "就这样，就有了连接杆"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11550.87, "timestamp": "03:12:30", "text": "车轴和曲轴。有一根杆子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11552.309, "timestamp": "03:12:32", "text": "连接发动机和螺旋桨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11554.95, "timestamp": "03:12:34", "text": "在飞机上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11558.87, "timestamp": "03:12:38", "text": "他们现在所做的就是在上面贴上凸起物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11567.349, "timestamp": "03:12:47", "text": "他们设法让你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11569.91, "timestamp": "03:12:49", "text": "驾驶舱内发出咔哒声，就会出现这种情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11571.99, "timestamp": "03:12:51", "text": "连接或断开与"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11574.63, "timestamp": "03:12:54", "text": "每次碰撞时都会触发真正的枪扳机"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11577.32, "timestamp": "03:12:57", "text": "挡路了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11578.389, "timestamp": "03:12:58", "text": "[音乐]"}]